---
// Lynik Innovations — About (concept mockup)
import './pharm-consult.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Lynik Innovations — About (Concept)</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap"
  />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">

    <header class="nav">
      <div class="wrap nav-row">
        <div class="wordmark-row">
          <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
          <div class="wordmark">
            <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
            <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult">Home</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about" class="active">About</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services">Services</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help">Who We Help</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-gold nav-cta">Let's Talk</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="wrap hero-row">
        <div class="hero">
          <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
          <h1>Experience Behind the Expertise.</h1>
          <p class="lede2">Lynik Innovations combines pharmaceutical Medical Information experience, scientific expertise, operational leadership, and an understanding of emerging technologies to help life sciences organizations solve practical challenges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-media">
          <div class="photo-block">
            <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="13" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12.5" r="3.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 6l1.2-2h5.6L16 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>
            <span class="cap">Photo — founder portrait</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-caption">
            "Better information.<br/>Better decisions.<br/>Greater impact."
            <div class="rule"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr .85fr;gap:44px;align-items:start">
        <div class="hero-media" style="aspect-ratio:4/5">
          <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — founder writing at desk</span></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">MEET THE FOUNDER</span>
          <h2 style="margin-top:10px;font-size:28px">PharmD. Medical Information Leader.<br/>Your Consulting Partner.</h2>
          <p class="lede" style="max-width:100%">Lynik Innovations was founded by a PharmD professional with extensive experience in pharmaceutical Medical Information content and operations. Our expertise includes managing Medical Information operations, developing scientific response resources, supporting complex medical inquiries, overseeing Medical Information workflows, supporting medical review activities, working with third-party contact centers, developing training, monitoring metrics, improving processes, and collaborating with cross-functional pharmaceutical teams.</p>
          <p class="lede" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:14px">This combination of clinical training, Medical Information expertise, and operational leadership allows Lynik Innovations to approach consulting challenges from both the scientific and business perspectives.</p>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-line" style="margin-top:26px">Connect With Me</a>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--sage-tint);border:1px solid var(--sage-line);border-radius:8px;padding:26px 24px">
          <h3 style="font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px">My Experience Includes</h3>
          <ul style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M6 4h9l4 4v12H6z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h6" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>Medical Information operations</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M10 3h4v5l4 8a2 2 0 01-1.8 2.9H7.8A2 2 0 016 16.8L10 8V3z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>Scientific response resources</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M12 21c-.4-4-2-6-6-8 4-1 6-3 6-8 .4 5 2 7 6 8-4 2-5.6 4-6 8z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Complex medical inquiries</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M20 20l-5-5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Literature searches</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M12 3l7 3v6c0 5-3 7.5-7 9-4-1.5-7-4-7-9V6l7-3z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Medical review</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="17" cy="8" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M3 20c0-3 2-4.5 5-4.5S13 17 13 20M12 20c0-3 2-4.5 5-4.5S22 17 22 20" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>Training</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M4 20V13M11 20V7M18 20v-9" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Metrics</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6.5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Process improvement</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M4 18v-4a4 4 0 014-4h8a4 4 0 014 4v4" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="2" y="18" width="4" height="4" rx="1" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3"/><rect x="18" y="18" width="4" height="4" rx="1" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>Third-party contact centers</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><circle cx="8" cy="12" r="5.5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="16" cy="12" r="5.5" stroke="var(--sage)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>Cross-functional collaboration</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><path d="M12 3c3.2 2.4 4.8 6 4.8 10 0 1.6-.3 2.9-.8 4H8c-.5-1.1-.8-2.4-.8-4 0-4 1.6-7.6 4.8-10z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>Launch readiness</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink)"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="flex-shrink:0"><rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1.2" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 3v5M12 16v5M3 12h5M16 12h5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>AI-enabled workflows</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">MY PHILOSOPHY</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:10px">Practical Solutions. Meaningful Impact.</h2>
        <p class="lede">I believe in understanding the problem, building the right solution, and making it sustainable. My goal is to deliver practical expertise that helps life sciences companies move forward &mdash; with confidence.</p>
        <div class="row-grid row-3">
          <div class="item divided first-col">
            <div class="icon-circle gold-ring"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 18h6M10 21h4M12 3a6 6 0 00-3.5 10.9c.6.4 1 1.1 1 1.9v.2h5v-.2c0-.8.4-1.5 1-1.9A6 6 0 0012 3z" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Understand the problem.</h3>
            <p>Listen, assess, and align with your goals.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle gold-ring"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Build the right solution.</h3>
            <p>Leverage expertise, experience, and best practices.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle gold-ring"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21c4-4.5 7-8 7-11.5A7 7 0 005 9.5C5 13 8 16.5 12 21z" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M12 13V8" stroke="var(--gold-deep)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Make it sustainable.</h3>
            <p>Create lasting value through practical, scalable solutions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">THE BIGGER PICTURE</span>
          <h2 style="margin-top:10px">A Vision for the Future</h2>
          <p class="lede" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:18px">Lynik Innovations is initially focused on Medical Information and Medical Affairs consulting, with the ability to expand into additional life sciences consulting services over time.</p>
          <p class="lede" style="max-width:100%;margin-top:14px">My long-term vision is to build a trusted consulting partner that supports life sciences companies across the full spectrum of needs &mdash; from Medical Information and Medical Affairs to Regulatory, Quality, and beyond.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-media" style="aspect-ratio:16/10">
          <div class="photo-block" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--sage-tint) 0%,var(--sage) 120%)">
            <span class="cap">Photo &mdash; green leaves, close-up</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-caption" style="left:24px;right:auto;text-align:left">
            Different needs.<br/>Same mission.
            <div class="rule"></div>
            <p style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:10px;color:var(--ink)">Better solutions<br/>for a healthier tomorrow.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark">
      <div class="wrap band-cta">
        <div class="left">
          <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">READY TO WORK TOGETHER?</span>
          <h2>Let's Discuss How Lynik Innovations Can Support Your Goals.</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Me</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="footer-top">
          <div class="wordmark-row">
            <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
            <div class="wordmark">
              <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
              <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <nav class="footer-nav">
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult">Home</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about">About</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services">Services</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help">Who We Help</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact">Contact</a>
          </nav>
          <div class="footer-contact">
            <span>info@lynikinnovations.com</span>
            <div class="social">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="3" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="7.2" cy="7.2" r="1.1" fill="rgba(247,245,239,.7)"/><path d="M6.2 10.5v7.3M10.4 10.5v7.3M10.4 13.6c0-1.8 1.2-3.1 2.9-3.1s2.7 1.1 2.7 3.3v4" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
          <span>&copy; 2026 Lynik Innovations. All rights reserved.</span>
          <span>Madison, Wisconsin</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>